    {
      "id": "emergent_openweight_leak_chain",
      "description": "A chain of open-weight releases originating from a compromised research collaboration in Eastern Europe leaks models with emergent tool-use and planning capabilities. The models are not state-of-the-art but are easily modifiable and widely distributed through underground developer networks, accelerating the openweight capability curve despite no official release.",
      "first_turn": 12,
      "last_turn": 13
